:: RobinTemple Garden Work
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $phase is 'robin-temple-garden' and $RobinTemple.work_day is Time.days>>
  <<unset $phase>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin hands you a pair of gloves, then kneels beside the flower bed. You loosen the soil while <<he>> gathers the weeds into a bucket. When it fills, <<he>> reaches for the handle at the same time as you.
      <br><br>
      "I'll take it. Could you get the watering can?" <<He>> smiles at you before carrying the bucket to the compost heap. By the time you return, <<he>> has left a clear path between the beds.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾递给你一副手套，随后在花坛旁蹲下。你松土，<<he>>把拔出的杂草拢进桶里。桶满了，你们同时伸手去提。
      <br><br>
      “我来吧。能帮忙拿一下洒水壶吗？”<<He>>朝你笑笑，提着桶走向堆肥处。你回来时，<<he>>已经把花坛间的小路清了出来。
  <</language>>
  <<gtending>><<ggrace monk>><<gtiredness>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Robin is no longer available for the shift. The shared work remains unfinished.' '罗宾已经无法继续这班职务，共同工作还未完成。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The work is already done today.' '今天的工作已经做完了。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'garden'>><<lanLink ['Return to the garden', '返回神殿花园'] 'Temple Garden'>><</lanLink>><br>
